<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia PSC six-mth net jumps 177 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia PSC six-mth net jumps 177 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   4.82   vs	   1.74</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 12.20   vs	   4.72</p>
<p>    Turnover		    94.04   vs	  40.00</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     5.47   vs	   2.49</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  1.25   vs  less   0.14</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - PSC Industries Bhd is involved in food products manufacturing, property and in marine engineering services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
